{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:54 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:54 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:54 2026-10-19 HKT</p><p>西營盤發生火警。今日（19日）晚上8時許，薄扶林道22至32號恆輝大廈中層一單位起火，大批居民疏散至樓下暫避。消防接報趕至，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊將火救熄，其間一名70多歲老翁被發現昏迷，隨即將其送院搶救。目前起火原因仍在調查。</p><p>火警期間，薄扶林道來回方向介乎第三街與皇后大道西之間的一段全線封閉，交通繁忙。運輸署呼籲，駕駛⼈⼠請考慮改⽤其他道路，並遵從在場警務⼈員指⽰。</p><img alt=\"起火單位冒煙。FB：西環變幻時\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c55a26db746d7c92b4b539ca6465024/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-19-22h06m09s928.png\"/><img alt=\"一名七旬翁昏迷送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81d6b464ebd4e62052f2f7324e312469/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_06_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防趕至撲救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ae114744c44635b7da60de68d2b5e2b3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_00_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防趕至撲救。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c8f5d959f77a4477ae2a7440b05d7e95/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_00_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位被熏黑。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e3e65f8968425958ef2d34acbbd65d12/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_10_02_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位被熏黑。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8318dd73d1417ed81579dcf00f44e5f4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_00_25.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批居民疏散至樓下暫避。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8f600d5ca32b0561c81f29ca5482ba49/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_00_24_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批居民疏散至樓下暫避。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a9d27eb652f28e01a2dd057306c21f8f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_00_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場協助。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a909e61f19c1d5ea0c646ffb2e7a2f78/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_22_00_26.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:22:18.813061+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"publi